# Prettier also skips everything in .gitignore.
package-lock.json
# The stylesheets keep short rules on one line (font faces, utilities); Prettier always expands them.
*.css
# Prose: Prettier pads tables and re-wraps lists, which only adds churn to the docs.
*.md
# Demo content is data, loaded into D1 by `npm run seed`; reformatting it would need a re-seed.
sites/*/content/
